Note on binaries

This license covers the gmplay source code in this repository. Built gmplay
binaries statically link third-party libraries under their own licenses:

  - FBInk   - GNU GPL v3.0   https://github.com/NiLuJe/FBInk
  - FFmpeg  - GNU LGPL v2.1 or later (built without GPL parts)  https://ffmpeg.org
  - The embedded UI font, DejaVu Sans (src/font_data.c), is under the
    Bitstream Vera / DejaVu font license.

Because of FBInk, a distributed gmplay binary as a whole is covered by the
GNU GPL v3.0.
